  "notes": [
    "URI versioning with defaultVersion 1, so every path is /v1/chat-sessions/...",
    "Payloads for events are open jsonb objects capped at 64 KiB.",
    "Wire event type strings are prefixed with mivia.chat.v1.",
    "Every SSE frame is NAMED after its event type, so EventSource.onmessage never fires; a client calls addEventListener once per entry in knownTypes."
